+*           Steam still rises through stagnant water at about Vgj: floor
+*           |G| in this term at the drift mass flux rho_l*Vgj (~150
+*           kg/m2/s).  Identical to upstream wherever |G| >= rho_l*Vgj.
+            F4=CO*((XFL*RHOL)+((1.0-XFL)*RHOG))+
+     >      (RHOL*RHOG*VGJ/MAX(GABS,RHOL*VGJ))
             EPS=(XFL*RHOL)/F4
